OL,3,GNEWSARebuilding Welsh Labour a marathon
OL,4,Anot a sprint, says new leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FRebuilding Welsh Labour after the
OL,7,FSenedd election will be "a marathon not
OL,8,Fa sprint," the party's new leader has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FHaving been in power in Wales since
OL,12,Fdevolution in 1999, Labour came third
OL,13,Fin May with just nine seats in a
OL,14,Fparliament expanded to 96 seats, having
OL,15,Fpreviously held 30 of the 60 seats.
OL,17,FAhead of his first party conference
OL,18,Fspeech as Welsh Labour leader on Sunday
OL,19,Fafternoon, Ken Skates said there were
OL,20,Freasons to be "optimistic" ahead of
OL,21,Fnext year's local elections.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
