OL,3,GNEWSARebuilding Welsh Labour a marathon
OL,4,Anot a sprint, says new leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, privately, some within the
OL,7,Fparty accept it could take "years" to
OL,8,Fwin back the support Welsh Labour lost
OL,9,Fat the Senedd election.
